{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12234240","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12234240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1223424001:0":{"text":"We owe you a big one this time...","source_cn":"刚才真是多亏了你……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x087D0CC7C808143C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We owe you a big one this time...","female":"We owe you a big one this time...","variant_male_record_index":"140296","variant_female_record_index":"140297","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1223424002:0":{"text":"The Carmine Whispers wouldn't have believed us if it weren't for you.","source_cn":"要不是你在，血薇帮不会相信我们的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE55552F0792680","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Carmine Whispers wouldn't have believed us if it weren't for you.","female":"The Carmine Whispers wouldn't have believed us if it weren't for you.","variant_male_record_index":"140298","variant_female_record_index":"140299","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1223424002":{"text":"The Carmine Whispers wouldn't have believed us if it weren't for you.","source_cn":"要不是你在，血薇帮不会相信我们的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE55552F0792680","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Carmine Whispers wouldn't have believed us if it weren't for you.","female":"The Carmine Whispers wouldn't have believed us if it weren't for you.","variant_male_record_index":"140298","variant_female_record_index":"140299","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223424003:0":{"text":"Got it!","source_cn":"我懂！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x587687FBCCB9E5E1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Got it!","female":"Got it!","variant_male_record_index":"140300","variant_female_record_index":"140301","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223424006:0":{"text":"By hook or by crook, we have to get rid of Renata.","source_cn":"事到如今，只有搞掉雷纳塔了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B8F841DB0C268C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223424007:1":{"text":"The thing is, how do we go about it?","source_cn":"问题是怎么搞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD202A7A3CAA51A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223424008:0":{"text":"We can't expect <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> to help us again! Let me take care of it this time!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x959728823FEA35F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We can't expect <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> to help us again! Let me take care of it this time!","female":"We can't expect <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> to help us again! Let me take care of it this time!","variant_male_record_index":"140308","variant_female_record_index":"140309","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223424009:1":{"text":"I'll take them down, even if it costs me my life!","source_cn":"老子弄不过他们，换命还是没问题的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78D85C5D0B7499AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223424010:1":{"text":"Come on, you can't even get close enough to Renata with so many people around her.","source_cn":"扯淡，就算你想硬碰硬，雷纳塔身边那么多人，根本不可能让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF996F427E103565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223424011:1":{"text":"What should we do then? Just let them be?","source_cn":"那咋办？咱就一直让他们这么搞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F7FC6E162878CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223424012:1":{"text":"You guys can go undercover.","source_cn":"不如将计就计，卧底进去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD37337CAB719B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1223424013:1":{"text":"Undercover?","source_cn":"卧底？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF018DE3845B36B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1223424014:1":{"text":"You all are Water Wights, right? It shouldn't be too hard to infiltrate their ranks.","source_cn":"你们不都是水鬼帮的吗，混进去不就得了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FE2A3AD7A555BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223424015:1":{"text":"Chippy gets what Hammie means! You can surrender to Renata!","source_cn":"漫漫的意思我理解了！你们可以投降雷纳塔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04AEC19920C3BAF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1223424016:1":{"text":"Surrender? No way!","source_cn":"投降？那可不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4080C0D5E1CEE46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1223424017:0":{"text":"You only need to fake it.\nJust ask Renata and her men out to discuss, then work with the Carmine Whispers to take them out!","source_cn":"不是真投降，是假装投降。\\n把雷纳塔那帮人约出来，然后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x294416132D2BB8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1223424018:1":{"text":"But... will they work with us?","source_cn":"但……血薇帮会跟我们合作？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D2E5EE52AB1EFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1223424018":{"text":"But... will they work with us?","source_cn":"但……血薇帮会跟我们合作？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D2E5EE52AB1EFD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1223424019:0":{"text":"I trust you.","source_cn":"有你担保就不怕了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x62C2E427FC65DB72","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I trust you.","female":"I trust you.","variant_male_record_index":"140320","variant_female_record_index":"140321","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1223424022:0":{"text":"Going undercover... Fine, let's do it.","source_cn":"卧底……行，那咱就这么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52040A5C3F212DD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1223424022":{"text":"Going undercover... Fine, let's do it.","source_cn":"卧底……行，那咱就这么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52040A5C3F212DD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1223424023:1":{"text":"What? We can't drag you into this mess again.","source_cn":"什么？不能再让你蹚这趟浑水了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA32E2587F681721F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What? We can't drag you into this mess again.","female":"What? We can't drag you into this mess again.","variant_male_record_index":"140327","variant_female_record_index":"140328","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1223424024:1":{"text":"You see, there's no way you guys can pull it off by yourselves. The Carmine Whispers won't cooperate without <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> involved.","source_cn":"得了吧，你们几个绝对搞不定，再说没有<style=st...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD41E68D4C773CDFE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You see, there's no way you guys can pull it off by yourselves. The Carmine Whispers won't cooperate without <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> involved.","female":"You see, there's no way you guys can pull it off by yourselves. The Carmine Whispers won't cooperate without <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> involved.","variant_male_record_index":"140329","variant_female_record_index":"140330","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1223424025:1":{"text":"You've got a point. Let's do it then.\nHonestly, having you around makes me feel much more at ease. Looks like we have to rely on your help again!","source_cn":"你说得对，那行吧。\\n其实你们进来，我也更放心些，又要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392452C3BC17CBA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"I'll go with you.","source_cn":"我也会加入","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D823BA83AA2C89D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'll go with you.","female":"I'll go with you.","variant_male_record_index":"67694","variant_female_record_index":"67695","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:1:2":{"text":"Count me in.","source_cn":"算我一个","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6EABE260018396DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Count me in.","female":"Count me in.","variant_male_record_index":"67696","variant_